# UI soul (required)

Noche Live is a **white, tactile Stories reel**. A live round without a full-bleed still, overlay chrome, and a pull-up sheet is unfinished. It is not a black TikTok skin and not a stack of admin cards.

- Canvas: warm white (`--paper`). Ink text. Gold is the only loud accent. No dark navy pages.
- Every screen: `.play-shot` (or stage/watch shot) + thin `.play-chrome` (ticks at the top) + `.play-sheet` / desk sheet. Watch is shot + chrome, no sheet. Swipe is `story` + `sheet`.
- Home, lobby, join, pick-team, rank-up, ceremony, finished night: same reel grammar as play. Never a padded `.play-card` + `.team-bar` as the live layout. Sheet padding uses the 8px gap scale (`--space-6` / `--space-7`).
- Player screens are **picture-first**: a child who cannot read should still know what to tap. Keep Spanish captions.
- Motion: press scale + ripple (`press`). Turbo swaps use View Transitions (`motion`). Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Do not add a CSS framework, a new palette, or dark mode.
- When touching `app/views`, `app/assets/stylesheets`, or Stimulus UI, follow `.cursor/skills/noche-ui/SKILL.md`.
